text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "type": "CR Text", "title": "保存名称统一控制", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [240, 200], "pos": [800, 0], "id": 55, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 3}, {"showAdvanced": true, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [65, 68], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}, {"name": "seconds", "links": [66], "label": "seconds", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "seconds"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["Cinematic Mandarin inspirational pop rock, introspective adult male vocal, restrained and emotional rather than overly heroic, warm slightly raspy voice, mature storytelling tone.\n\nStart intimate and minimal with soft piano, subtle ambient pads, low cello and sparse acoustic guitar. The verses should feel lonely, reflective and confessional, like a man sitting alone late at night confronting his own procrastination, fear and unrealized life.\n\nGradually build through the pre-chorus with muted drums, bass and atmospheric electric guitar.\n\nThe chorus should open into a powerful but controlled cinematic pop-rock arrangement: live drums, electric guitars, strings, deep bass and wide backing vocals. Strong memorable melodic hook, emotional uplift without sounding like generic motivational corporate music.\n\nSecond verse becomes firmer and more determined, representing discipline, daily practice and choosing action over waiting for inspiration.\n\nFor the bridge, dramatically strip the instrumentation back. Nearly spoken male vocal over minimal piano and heartbeat-like percussion on the lines about sitting down, turning on the light, picking up the pen and beginning. Create a moment of silence before the final chorus.\n\nFinal chorus should feel expansive, cathartic and resolute, with full live drums, orchestral strings, electric guitar, layered backing vocals and subtle choir textures. The emotion is not “I conquered everything,” but “the enemy will return tomorrow, and so will I.”\n\nEnd by gradually removing the instruments until only piano, ambient room tone and the male voice remain.\n\nTempo: 76–82 BPM  \nTime signature: 4/4  \nKey feeling: minor verses transitioning toward a brighter relative major feeling in the chorus  \nVocal: Chinese male, 35–45 years old, warm, slightly weathered, restrained, sincere, powerful only at emotional peaks  \nGenre: cinematic pop rock / adult contemporary / inspirational soundtrack  \nMood progression: self-doubt → recognition → discipline → confrontation → quiet determination → cathartic resolve  \nProduction: organic live instruments, cinematic dynamics, spacious mix, strong emotional contrast  \nAvoid: cheerful pop, idol-style vocal, excessive shouting, EDM drops, trap beats, overly heroic military feeling, generic corporate inspirational music", "[Verse 1]\n我曾把很多没有开始\n叫作时机还不合适\n把害怕藏进计划里\n把退缩说成深思熟虑\n\n我收藏了太多远方\n却一直站在原地眺望\n等某一天变得勇敢\n等某一道光替我开场\n\n后来才终于看清\n挡在门口的不是命运\n那个最懂我的敌人\n原来一直住在我心里\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n它说再等等吧\n今天状态不好\n它说再改改吧\n现在还不够好\n\n它从不会把路堵死\n只是让我\n明天再走\n\n[Chorus]\n可我还有一个人生\n在没有走过的路上等我\n那些没有写完的故事\n没有说出口的选择\n\n我不是输给了世界\n只是太多次输给没出发的我\n所以今天不等勇敢\n就带着害怕往前走\n\n哪怕只写下一行\n哪怕只走出一步\n我知道明天它还会来\n\n那我\n明天也会来\n\n[Verse 2]\n我曾以为灵感来了\n一切自然就会不同\n后来才知道那束光\n常在开始以后才亮\n\n不是喜欢才去坚持\n不是确信才敢启程\n有人只是每天坐下\n把该做的事情做成\n\n不问今天有没有掌声\n不问谁会不会看见\n把时间交给一件事情\n把借口留在门外面\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n它还是会告诉我\n你根本做不到\n它还是会提醒我\n别人已经走得很远了\n\n可这一次我听见它\n却不再回答\n\n我只是\n继续做\n\n[Chorus]\n因为我还有一个人生\n在没有走过的路上等我\n那些被我推迟的梦想\n从来没有真正离开过\n\n我不是一定要赢世界\n只是不想再输给没出发的我\n所以今天不等答案\n先把第一步走完再说\n\n哪怕没有掌声\n哪怕没人祝福\n我知道明天它还会来\n\n那我\n明天也会来\n\n[Bridge]\n也许真正的战争\n从来没有结束那天\n\n恐惧不会消失\n怀疑不会走远\n懒惰会换一个名字\n躲进每一个明天\n\n我也终于不再奢望\n有一天变得无所畏惧\n\n我只需要在它出现的时候\n认出它\n\n然后\n\n坐下来\n打开灯\n拿起笔\n开始\n\n[Final Chorus]\n我终于走向那个人生\n那个曾被我一次次错过的我\n不是因为我不再害怕\n而是害怕也不能替我选择\n\n我不需要战胜全世界\n只要今天别再输给昨天的我\n当那声音再次告诉我\n算了吧 明天再说\n\n我会把门轻轻关上\n把灯打开\n把手里的事继续做\n\n因为明天它还会来\n\n我知道\n\n明天它还会来\n\n而我\n也会来\n\n[Outro]\n不是等待成为谁\n才开始这一生\n\n是从开始的那天起\n\n我终于\n成为我自己", 1030393007655753, "randomize", 300.00000000000006, 1.7, 50], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 64, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "caption"}, "name": "caption", "link": 82, "label": "caption", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "caption"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "link": 83, "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_duration"}, "name": "max_duration", "label": "max_duration", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "max_duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg_scale"}, "name": "cfg_scale", "label": "cfg_scale", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg_scale"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_k"}, "name": "top_k", "label": "top_k", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "top_k"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "type": "MiniMaxMusic3TextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [240, 750], "pos": [1040, 0], "id": 45, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.31.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"seed": true}, "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxMusic3TextEncode"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [83], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["[Intro]\\n\\n[Verse 1]\\n暮雨收在青瓦边\\n石桥依旧枕着浅浅溪涧\\n竹篱深处炊烟起\\n一声犬吠认归人\\n\\n[Pre-Chorus]\\n从前总嫌山路远\\n总想走到云那边\\n如今望见窗前灯\\n脚步却慢了半拍\\n\\n[Chorus]\\n山月照我肩\\n泉声绕石阶\\n灯下有人添一双筷\\n还像从前\\n我把风尘轻轻掸\\n坐回你身边\\n\\n[Verse 2]\\n木桌还靠着南窗\\n蒲扇搁在旧竹椅旁\\n你问这些年过得怎样\\n我说先尝尝你的汤\\n\\n[Pre-Chorus]\\n你笑着又添一勺\\n说山里今年天凉\\n我把想说的话放一放\\n伸手合上了半扇窗\\n\\n[Chorus]\\n山月照我肩\\n泉声绕石阶\\n灯下有人添一双筷\\n还像从前\\n我把风尘轻轻掸\\n坐回你身边\\n\\n[Instrumental]\\n\\n[Bridge]\\n从前只顾走得快\\n没看你站了多久\\n这次让门外的风先走\\n我陪你坐到月落以后\\n\\n[Chorus]\\n山月照我肩\\n泉声绕石阶\\n灯下有人添一双筷\\n还像从前\\n我把风尘轻轻掸\\n坐回你身边\\n\\n[Outro]\\n泉水还绕着旧石阶\\n你说回来就好\\n饭还热着呢"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [0, 0], "id": 69, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [82], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["### Global Metadata\\nA warm Mandarin guofeng ballad centered on guzheng, xiao, guqin, and one male singer. Use a relaxed, flowing tempo and pentatonic melodic color. Aim for a complete song of approximately three minutes, leaving enough room to sing every supplied line naturally. Begin intimately, let the recurring chorus become warmer and more open, and end quietly with a resolved cadence. Keep the principal melodic figure recognizable across repeats. The production should retain clear plucked-string attacks, natural woodwind breath, and a close vocal presence, with restrained room ambience and a gradual dynamic arc.\\n\\n### Vocal Details\\nOne male lead with a warm, clear mid-register tone and precise Mandarin articulation. Sing the verses conversationally while maintaining a continuous melody. Allow longer lyric lines to stretch across the phrase rather than rushing or dropping words. Give the chorus a gently lifted register and sustained endings, keeping the performance tender and controlled. Use contemporary ballad phrasing with light Chinese melodic ornamentation, without operatic delivery. Keep the singer exposed and intelligible; the final short lines should remain softly sung. Backing vocals are unnecessary.\\n\\n### Arrangement\\n[Intro] Begin with sparse guqin tones and harmonics, then introduce a short guzheng figure that will recur between vocal sections. Keep the introduction brief.\\n\\n[Verse 1] Bring in the male lead over lightly spaced guzheng accompaniment. Guqin supplies occasional low resonances; leave gaps around phrase endings.\\n\\n[Pre-Chorus] Increase the guzheng pulse slightly. Let xiao answer the last vocal phrase, preparing the chorus without covering consonants.\\n\\n[Chorus] Present the central hook clearly. Widen the guzheng voicings and use xiao only between sung phrases. Guqin maintains a soft, grounded foundation.\\n\\n[Verse 2] Return to the close, sparse verse texture while keeping the same underlying pulse and instrumental identity.\\n\\n[Pre-Chorus] Rebuild with a little more flowing guzheng movement, preserving space for the longer phrases.\\n\\n[Chorus] Repeat the established melody with slightly fuller resonance and stronger, still gentle vocal projection.\\n\\n[Instrumental] Let xiao briefly take the chorus melody over guzheng, with guqin marking the transition.\\n\\n[Bridge] Thin the accompaniment to guqin and isolated guzheng responses. Gradually reopen the vocal tone toward the final chorus.\\n\\n[Chorus] Deliver the warmest statement of the hook, using instrumental interplay and vocal expression rather than a sudden loudness jump.\\n\\n[Outro] Withdraw xiao, simplify the guzheng part, and let the final sung phrases settle over guqin. Finish with a natural harmonic decay and a complete ending."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [400, 0], "id": 68, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 84, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {